Subject: Re: [geomorph-r-package] Troubles to get and display size-corrected residuals on 3D mesh.
Message-ID: <TtcKynm-Xps.GjXoh5ObCwAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <TtcKynm-Xps.bMrAZsuaCwAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
