It is important to remind everyone plotting in ggplot2 that they need to include the argument coord_fixed() (to ensure an aspect ratio of 1). That is not the default (as it is for plot(gm.prcomp()). I have recently seen many plots of principal components of shape made in ggplot2 that omit that argument, so apparently it is not obvious that this is necessary.

